<title>USA: Nortech to acquire circuit board unit.</title>
<headline>Nortech to acquire circuit board unit.</headline>
<dateline>HECTOR, Minn. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nortech Systems Inc said Tuesday it has signed a definitive agreement to acquire Zercom Corp, a circuit board assembly unit, from Communications Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Nortech, an electrical equipment maker, said it plans to operate Zercom as an independent division.</p>
<p>Communications Systems, which manufactures telecommunications equipment, said the sale of the unit will allow it to focus on the telecommunications industry.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
